  "id": "spark-job",
  "name": "Spark-style partitioned URL count and recovery",
  "description": "A driver dispatches six named input partitions to three distinct executors. Map output blocks are shuffled by URL key before reductions. Key skew and bounded RAM cause measured synthetic spill delay. Lost executor-local blocks are recomputed from their input partitions.",
