  "notes": [
    {
      "id": "assumptions",
      "text": "Synthetic Spark-style job, not a live Apache Spark deployment. Generated input URLs are actual records: map partitions produce keyed blocks and reducers retrieve every dependency over the drawn shuffle edges. No map-side combining is assumed for transfer size. Executor-local RAM and synthetic disk blocks are both lost on crash. Full checkpoint/replay is owned by the shared coordinator.",
